<title>UK: Banca di Roma sets 300 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Banca di Roma sets 300 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCA DI ROMA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    02.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE   L01.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.678    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.678</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG LAST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/IT/CI  NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
